WEBVTT

00:36:28.741 --> 00:36:31.472
I mean, you're talking about technology

00:36:31.496 --> 00:36:33.983
that is incredibly strategic
for the future.

00:36:34.007 --> 00:36:36.927
If we end up in a kind of an arms race,

00:36:36.951 --> 00:36:40.173
where two countries feel like

00:36:40.197 --> 00:36:44.672
their future ability
to influence the world is at stake,

00:36:44.696 --> 00:36:46.729
that's a recipe for breakneck development

00:36:46.753 --> 00:36:49.714
without paying attention to things

00:36:49.738 --> 00:36:53.307
that some people really need to be
paying attention to when it comes to AI,

00:36:53.331 --> 00:36:57.829
such as trying to embed
human values into it,

00:36:57.853 --> 00:37:00.045
of the right kind.